For every category-B-recommendation every clinician must help a patient with a category-B-decision.
Every clinician must consider a patient-value during a category-B-decision.
Every clinician must consider a patient-preference during a category-B-decision.
Every clinician must consider a specific-clinical-situation during a category-B-decision.
Every clinician must use a shared-decision-making during a category-B-decision.
